# Clinic

Help clinics manage appointments.

## Entity Appointment: id: ID, status: draft | active | archived
## Entity Patient: id: ID, name: Text
## Capability bookAppointment `capability.bookAppointment`
- requires: []
- mutates: []
- emits: []
## Capability confirmAppointment `capability.confirmAppointment`
- requires: ['permission.appointment.confirm']
- mutates: ['field.appointment.status']
- emits: []
## Surface Schedule `surface.schedule` — components ['component.schedule.calendar', 'component.schedule.appointmentList']
## Flow BookAppointment `flow.bookAppointment` — actor actor.patient, goal None